        <head>BOWLING.</head>
        <p>BOWLING.</p>
        <p>LANCASHIRE AND CHESHIRE COUNTY ASSOCIATION. SECOND TEAM COMPETITION. FINAL TIF. •</p>
        <p>WIIITEFIFLD v. WARRINGTON CENIETERY.—These teams met in the final of the association competition on the grtea adjoining the Trafford Hotel, Old Trafford, on Saturday. Score*. :</p>
        <p>WHITEFIELD. WIRRINGTON. .1. Berry . 21 J. Marks .T. A11en.... 2l A Foster l7 H. Crossley 2l W. Hill ' . 5 .1. Suith R. Butt:men 2l A. Allisln. G. Duchwortb 2l W. Barton. ll .1. Boyle J. Hilton E. Nuttall . 13 J. R. Trigger J. Crawahaw l7 R. Sunderland 2l H. Holroyd . J. Smith</p>
