      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1909-08-14_WidnesExaminer_art0067" n="art0067">
        <head>BEAUTY SHOW.</head>
        <p>BEAUTY SHOW.</p>
        <p>Fo kessone is perplexing i'self over the merits of the rival beauths of England and France. A beautiful Parisienne has been elec'e I "Queen of Beau y Queens" and she is to challenge the claims cf the belles of England as put forward by Folkestone. Our photograrh shows a ycung lady from Tunbridge Wells who is an aspirant for the beauty championship which is to be decided At Folkestone on Tuesday next.</p>
