      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1909-08-14_WidnesExaminer_art0068" n="art0068">
        <head>PRINCE'S SOCIAL RUIN;</head>
        <p>PRINCE'S SOCIAL RUIN;</p>
        <p>'Prince Hermann of Saxe-Weimar has been going the pace to such an extent that he has had to renounce his posit on of heir to thn Grand Duchy of Saxe-Weimar, which is held by ou?. of the oldest German families. A yeas ago he was in debt to Berlin moneylenders to the tune of £BO,OOO. He was dismissed his regiment then, and now as a result of his life of wanton extravagance he has been compzlled to give up his right of succession. He is only 23 years of age.</p>
      </div>
