        <p>NOR'l HERN UNION JUNIOR CUP DRAW. At a Northern Union meeting in Manchester, on Tuesday night, the draw for the first round of the Lancashire Junior Cup resulted :—Wigan Highfield v. Ince, Pemberton v. Leigh Shamrock, Heyside v. Rad- cliffe Rangers, Prestwich Church v. Swinten Hornets, Salford St. Bart.'s v. Wardley-lane, Cadishead and Irlam v. Flixton ; Egerton and Barrow St. George's byes. The venue of the match between Lancashire and Cumberland, on October 4th, was fixed for the Barrow ground. It was resolved to grant £lOO to .the British Playieg Fields Society,</p>
